    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> be the solution of the differential equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>x</mi></mstyle></mrow></mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mo>+</mo></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>y</mi></mstyle></mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>x</mi></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>sec</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mstyle></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> satisfying the condition <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>. Then, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math> is</p>",
